</element-citation></ref><ref id="CR27"><label>27.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Nam KM, Gursan A, Bhogal AA, et al (2023) Deuterium echo-planar spectroscopic imaging (EPSI) in the human liver in vivo at 7 T. Magn Reson Med 90:863&#x02013;874. 10.1002/mrm.29696</mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>